<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--

    This fixture is not a real iTerm2 export. The theme worker wrote it by
    hand, to test that the parser of pirate tolerates the two extra keys that
    a real iTerm2 export adds to every color: `Color Space` and
    `Alpha Component`. The two real fixtures beside this file (3024 night and
    atom one light) hold neither key, so this is the one file that proves the
    tolerance.

-->
